    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在2026年的这个暑假，有可能你毕业了，你迎来了一个新的身份和不可知的未来。来听听怎么渡过毕业之后的第一个暑假吧。本期播客简短且干货满满，听完带着收获走。</span></p><p></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> “毕业”的多重含义</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> 暑假可以做的三件事 </span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="335">05:35</a> 规划暑假是一种能力</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="410">06:50</a> 核心能力一</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 核心能力二</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="639">10:39</a> 核心能力三</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 核心能力四</span></p></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Music: Jungle by Qlowdy </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/qlowdymusic" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/qlowdymusic"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p><p><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution 3.0 Unported — CC BY 3.0</span></p><p><span>Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://links.al/AuX" data-url="https://links.al/AuX"><span>links.al</span></a></p><p><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://links.al/youtube" data-url="https://links.al/youtube"><span>links.al</span></a></p><p><span>欢迎点赞、收藏、分享和关注我的播客呀</span></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
