  <item>
    <title>21.高考报考之AI辅助报考</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a20bf447444b5722232fd2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a20bf447444b5722232fd2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>随着高考的即将到来，参加报考的学生们和学生的家长也需要面对报考哪所学校和哪些专业的“重要议题”，本期我来讲讲孩子适合学什么、专业到底学什么、以及家长与孩子意见不一致时如何理性决策。</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a> AI辅助报考用到哪些工具</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="172">02:52</a> 孩子到底适合学什么</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 报了这个专业，将来学什么</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="819">13:39</a> 家长与孩子意见不一致时怎么办</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1127">18:47</a> 做一个小小的实验</span></p></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Music: Night Waves by Qlowdy </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/qlowdymusic" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/qlowdymusic"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p><p><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution 3.0 Unported — CC BY 3.0</span></p><p><span>Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://links.al/BH4" data-url="https://links.al/BH4"><span>links.al</span></a></p><p><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://links.al/youtube" data-url="https://links.al/youtube"><span>links.al</span></a><br></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>本期播客提到的模型使用的</span><a href="https://my.feishu.cn/docx/FB0xdHoESo3hvexKB4ocixdCn6f?from=from_copylink" data-url="https://my.feishu.cn/docx/FB0xdHoESo3hvexKB4ocixdCn6f?from=from_copylink"><span>提示词</span></a></p><p><span>欢迎点赞、收藏、分享和关注我的播客呀</span></p></blockquote><p></p>]]></description>
