  <item>
    <title>20.我对高考有话说</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a07e1ea1b7bd502953e34c3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a07e1ea1b7bd502953e34c3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 16 May 2026 03:24:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>终于有专题了，在不能做专题的时候，我的想法是攒一个高考的专题，能帮到报考的学生和家长就是好事，没帮到至少普及了一些当前最新的讯息和认知，避免有些家长被割韭菜，dt帮助具体的人。现在做到了，很高兴地在比较紧张的时间里录了一期，如果没讲到位还请多多包涵，后面持续更新，交作业。</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><ul><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 2026年高考模式解析</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 选科与报考专业的关系</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="609">10:09</a> 报考时考虑点什么</span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="803">13:23</a> 一个小小总结 </span></p></li><li><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 2026年高考新增报考专业</span></p></li></ul><p></p><blockquote><p><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Music: For her by Wanheda </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/user-724527508" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/user-724527508"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></p><p><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Unported - CC BY-SA 3.0</span></p><p><span>Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://links.al/lks" data-url="https://links.al/lks"><span>links.al</span></a></p><p><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://links.al/youtube" data-url="https://links.al/youtube"><span>links.al</span></a><br></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>欢迎点赞、收藏、分享和关注我的播客呀 </span></p></blockquote><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
