  <item>
    <title>19.AI的工具性与创意性两者兼得吗</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e46b131d989496e7f6242d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e46b131d989496e7f6242d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Apr 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><span>似乎伴随着AI的发展，AI的工具性与创意性，类比于鱼与熊掌不可兼得，AI生成的内容越来越可控，但似乎也安全得没有突破了，也许你会有一个疑问“难道我不可以两个都要吗？”“我想又保证质量又想有些飞的突破常规的点”，本期我们来聊聊，没准你两个都可以得到呢</span></p><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="119">01:59</a> 完美的AI</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="236">03:56</a> 近亲繁殖的AI（Habsburg AI）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> AI与人类对齐的利弊</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 人类的持续创新与AI的自我重复</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> RLHF（基于人类反馈的强化学习）影响到大模型的创造力和人类的输出</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">12:22</a> </span><strong><span>Prose Sandwich（散文三明治法）的上层、中层与下层</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 举个例子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 变量的引入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1154">19:14</a> 高阶玩家可尝试</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1358">22:38</a> </span><strong><span>新的内容主题征集，你的意见超重要</span></strong></p><blockquote><p><span>你想收听哪个主题/话题，来加小助手微信guanweilai2026，或者在评论区留言，我们一起共创/实现你的愿望</span></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>参考链接：</span><a href="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/model-collapse" data-url="https://www.ibm.com/think/topics/model-collapse"><span>what is model collapse</span></a><span> &nbsp;</span><a href="https://anderson-review.ucla.edu/ai-from-ai-a-future-of-generic-and-biased-online-content/" data-url="https://anderson-review.ucla.edu/ai-from-ai-a-future-of-generic-and-biased-online-content/"><span>AI from AI: a Future of Generic and Biased Online Content?</span></a><span> &nbsp;</span><a href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s12559-026-10568-9" data-url="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s12559-026-10568-9"><span>LLM Alignment should go beyond Harmlessness–Helpfulness and incorporate Human Agency</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Music: Pixel Duck by Johny Grimes </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/johny-grimes" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/johny-grimes"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><span> License: Creative Commons — Attribution 3.0 Unported — CC BY 3.0 Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://links.al/O90" data-url="https://links.al/O90"><span>links.al</span></a><span> Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://links.al/youtube" data-url="https://links.al/youtube"><span>links.al</span></a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><span>欢迎点赞、收藏、分享和关注我的播客呀</span></p></blockquote>]]></description>
