    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c480ee852cf1b8bbe74758</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Mar 2026 00:45:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近看到了很多微博和贴子在讲一个人如何利用有限的AI资源学会了看似很困难的大学课程，出于好奇与兴趣，我快速上手了网络热议的方法，并总结出了自己的AI学习大学课程的公式，不妨来听听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="129">02:09</a> 何为表演学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="203">03:23</a> 怎么判断自己有没有“中表演学习的招”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> 【干货】大学课程学习公式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> 【做法】具体讲讲公式里的每一项如何去做&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1258">20:58</a> 【AI含量100%】AI怎么帮助我们学习大学课程？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">26:27</a> 【实例】用AI学AI</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>如果你想有机会和主播线上、线下交流，欢迎加小助手微信guanweilai2026，邀请进群，每月组织一次线上会，不定期组织线下交流会（北京、天津）</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Music: Night Ride by Joshua Moses </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/joshuamosesmusic" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/joshuamosesmusic"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution 4.0 International — CC BY 4.0</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://audiolibrary.com.co/joshua-moses/night-ride" data-url="https://audiolibrary.com.co/joshua-moses/night-ride"><span>audiolibrary.com.co</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://youtu.be/tJdcn6cGdC0" data-url="https://youtu.be/tJdcn6cGdC0"><span>youtu.be</span></a></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>灵感来源：</span><a href="https://waytoagi.feishu.cn/wiki/Mbg5w582MiGZuQkiiDIcF1O0n9e?from=from_copylink" data-url="https://waytoagi.feishu.cn/wiki/Mbg5w582MiGZuQkiiDIcF1O0n9e?from=from_copylink"><span>飞书文章</span></a><span