    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Mar 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期从阿萌老师最近感触很深的一篇文章开启（文末附链接），引申到有了AI之后每个人可能面临的原子化生活形态，再聊聊如何抵御原子化，希望可以启发到你。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="26">00:26</a> The bitter lesson, 我把它译为苦涩的一课</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> </span><strong><span>启示1: 通用方法的巨大作用</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">02:21</a> </span><strong><span>启示2:设计元方法元工具去发现世界的复杂性</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="219">03:39</a> 过去听疗愈音乐付费找平台，现在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a> 过去记录心情找平台担心隐私，现在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 过去学代码付费上课，现在？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 当日问，当日毕 【一日事，一日毕】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 原子化是好事还是坏事？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> </span><strong><span>如何抵抗原子化</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="956">15:56</a> 有所保留与敞开心扉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1116">18:36</a> 有迷失有焦虑，都不要紧</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Youtube Audio Library， Music: Early Bird by Jay Someday </span><a href="https://soundcloud.com/jaysomeday" data-url="https://soundcloud.com/jaysomeday"><span>soundcloud.com</span></a><span>License: Creative Commons — Attribution 3.0 Unported — CC BY 3.0Free Download / Stream: </span><a href="https://audiolibrary.com.co/jay-someday/early-bird" data-url="https://audiolibrary.com.co/jay-someday/early-bird"><span>audiolibrary.com.co</span></a><span>Music promoted by Audio Library: </span><a href="https://youtu.be/97cUPR_2yLs" data-url="https://youtu.be/97cUPR_2yLs"><span>youtu.be</span></a></blockquote>