    <title>16.也谈空杯心态</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6986dc2ea22480add6ef5a2d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6986dc2ea22480add6ef5a2d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Feb 2026 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期从最近爆火的OpenClaw入手，谈谈在AI应用大爆发的时代，我们每一个普通人可以拥有的空杯心态。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> OpenClaw 一匹黑马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="197">03:17</a> 新时代的OTT</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="305">05:05</a> 一些成功应用AI让自己变得更多的三个案例</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> </span><strong><span>利亚姆·奥特利 Liam Ottley 无代码创业者</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="404">06:44</a> </span><strong><span>麦凯·里格利 McKay Wrigley AI代码指挥人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> </span><strong><span>Rowan Cheung 自动化内容媒体人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 一点个人进步：从一年前无代码基础到发布代码至github</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="751">12:31</a> 对技术的祛魅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="799">13:19</a> 从Rundown AI列举的教育工作者和学生应用AI的例子看看教育人如何使用AI</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 展开讲学生场景的应用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> </span><strong><span>划重点：教育从业者和学生在内容需求的两个定位差异</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1155">19:15</a> 互动式/自主式学习对应的是空杯心态</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1245">20:45</a> 放下你的Ego（自我）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">21:42</a> </span><strong><span>没时间？听最后一段总结，再回到感兴趣的片段</span></strong></p><span></span><blockquote><span>播客Intro/Outro音乐：Youtube Audio Library， 推荐来源OpenClaw</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>播客AI剪辑：descript, 推荐来源OpenClaw</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><a href="https://my.feishu.cn/docx/LYGFdU1I