    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊一个相对比较大的话题，再次回归到教育的主命题上，和各位探讨一下在AI的加持下，教育会平等还是不平等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目时间线：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="39">00:39</a> 在线教育语境下的平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 再度回忆“双减”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">03:02</a> AI+教育结合的场景较少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="252">04:12</a> 假设一：AI的参与会使教育更平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> 假设二：AI的参与会使教育更加不平等</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a> 一则媒体报道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 一则论文</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 手机多用少用似乎都不太好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 继续列举支持“不平等”的假设的假设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 本期彩蛋</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>封面图片：千问</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>播客背景音乐：Suno生成，歌词和歌曲风格均由Gemini生成</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>记得点赞、分享和关注我的播客呀</span></blockquote>]]></description>
